00:14:33,860 --> 00:14:38,860
If the AI texture image you want to generate is not affected by any pattern type,

237
00:14:38,860 --> 00:14:42,860
you only want to generate it through the material type and keyword,

238
00:14:42,860 --> 00:14:44,860
you can select no pattern type.

239
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:49,860
Through the pattern size, the size of a loop pattern can be adjusted to four levels.

240
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:54,860
When choosing the material and pattern type, the pattern size is default to 1.

241
00:14:54,860 --> 00:15:00,860
If the pattern size is set to 1, it will generate nearly 1024 pixels at random.

242
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:01,860
If the pattern size is set to 1,

243
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:04,860
if the pattern size is set to 4,

244
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:08,860
it will generate nearly 4096 pixels at random,

245
00:15:08,860 --> 00:15:12,860
which is 4 times the size of 1024 pixels.

246
00:15:12,860 --> 00:15:14,860
Next, enter the keyword.

247
00:15:14,860 --> 00:15:18,860
Note that the current text can only be entered in English.

248
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:21,860
After entering the prompt, the button starts to generate.

249
00:15:21,860 --> 00:15:23,860
When creating a generated AI pattern,

250
00:15:23,860 --> 00:15:25,860
the left number is deducted.

251
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:28,860
And in the process of generating AI,

252
00:15:28,860 --> 00:15:30,860
you can see the server prompt and progress.

253
00:15:31,860 --> 00:15:34,860
After the AI pattern is generated,

254
00:15:34,860 --> 00:15:35,860
click on the application,

255
00:15:35,860 --> 00:15:37,860
apply the object to 3D clothing,

256
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:39,860
and you can see the result in advance.

257
00:15:39,860 --> 00:15:41,860
When entering the keyword,

258
00:15:41,860 --> 00:15:42,860
it is recommended to enter the word,

259
00:15:42,860 --> 00:15:44,860
not the long text.

260
00:15:44,860 --> 00:15:47,860
The long text may lead to the image missing.

261
00:15:47,860 --> 00:15:50,860
Therefore, use the dot or control grid to divide the word.

262
00:15:50,860 --> 00:15:54,860
Finally, click on the start generation to see the result.

263
00:15:54,860 --> 00:15:57,860
If you want to highlight some of the characteristics of the word,

264
00:15:57,860 --> 00:16:00,860
you can add a keyword to the keyword.

265
00:16:00,860 --> 00:16:02,860
When using the keyword,

266
00:16:02,860 --> 00:16:04,860
use once to emphasize 1.1 times.

267
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:07,860
Use twice to emphasize 1.1 square times.

268
00:16:07,860 --> 00:16:10,860
When entering yellow sky and adding weight to them,

269
00:16:10,860 --> 00:16:12,860
you can see that the generated image result

270
00:16:12,860 --> 00:16:15,860
adds more weight with the increase of the keyword.

271
00:16:19,860 --> 00:16:21,860
In the lower right corner of the keyword prompt,

272
00:16:21,860 --> 00:16:23,860
there is a flash-shaped icon.

273
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:28,860
Its function is to maintain the material type and pattern size of the front setting unchanged.

274
00:16:28,860 --> 00:16:31,860
You can select the pattern type and keyword prompt randomly,

275
00:16:31,860 --> 00:16:35,860
and you can generate different types of text and applications in this way.

276
00:16:35,860 --> 00:16:37,860
The function of the real-type icon is

277
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:41,860
to generate similar text patterns under the maintenance of the existing pattern.

278
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:43,860
Because even if you enter the same prompt,

279
00:16:43,860 --> 00:16:46,860
different text results will be generated each time.

280
00:16:46,860 --> 00:16:50,860
If you want to keep the style of the existing text pattern as much as possible,

281
00:16:50,860 --> 00:16:52,860
you can click on the real-type icon.

282
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,860
The mouse will be suspended on the real-type icon,

283
00:16:55,860 --> 00:16:57,860
and the tool prompt will be displayed.

284
00:16:57,860 --> 00:16:59,860
Just like the description in the tool prompt,

285
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:00,860
by clicking it,

286
00:17:00,860 --> 00:17:05,860
you can generate a new pattern that is similar to the previous generated text pattern.

287
00:17:05,860 --> 00:17:08,860
Remember, if the results are different,

288
00:17:08,860 --> 00:17:12,860
the details still depend on the prompt added or modified.

289
00:17:12,860 --> 00:17:15,860
In addition, the window of the AI text generator can be minimized.

290
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:18,860
When a large number of users generate text at the same time,

291
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:20,860
it takes some time to complete.

292
00:17:20,860 --> 00:17:22,860
If the waiting time is longer,

293
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:25,860
you can minimize the window by clicking the arrow on the upper right corner.

294
00:17:25,860 --> 00:17:27,860
Once the material is generated,

295
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:29,860
the text prompt will be updated

296
00:17:29,860 --> 00:17:31,860
to achieve the effective use of software.

297
00:17:31,860 --> 00:17:35,860
Next, the last main function I want to introduce is the link editing.

298
00:17:35,860 --> 00:17:37,860
From the 7.3 version,

299
00:17:37,860 --> 00:17:40,860
we can simultaneously edit the link lines in the version,

300
00:17:40,860 --> 00:17:42,860
thereby improving the efficiency of work.

301
00:17:42,860 --> 00:17:45,860
Not only the outer outline or inner line of the version,

302
00:17:45,860 --> 00:17:48,860
but also the sewing line can be adjusted at the same time.

303
00:17:48,860 --> 00:17:52,860
This function is composed of link lines and editing link tools.

304
00:17:52,860 --> 00:17:55,860
The link tool will set the link to the selected part of the line.

305
00:17:55,860 --> 00:17:59,860
The editing link tool will change the link line according to the selected option.

306
00:17:59,860 --> 00:18:04,860
Next, we will show you how to set the selected line as a link

307
00:18:04,860 --> 00:18:10,860
through the link tool and how to edit the link line through the link editing function.

308
00:18:10,860 --> 00:18:17,860
Next, let's see how to operate a series of operations on the Jack board.

309
00:18:17,860 --> 00:18:21,860
Select the edit board tool from the 2D tool bar,

310
00:18:21,860 --> 00:18:23,860
and then select the line to be set to the link line

311
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,860
to be set to the link line.

312
00:18:25,860 --> 00:18:27,860
Right-click on the line,

313
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:31,860
and find the link line at the bottom of the list.

314
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:33,860
When you click on the link line,

315
00:18:33,860 --> 00:18:35,860
the selected line will be displayed in blue.

316
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,860
When we stop the mouse

317
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:40,860
on the outer outline of the version to be set to the link,

318
00:18:40,860 --> 00:18:42,860
it will display the two lines with the empty line,

319
00:18:42,860 --> 00:18:44,860
and they will be linked.

320
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:48,860
At this time, the setting direction of the link line depends on the selected direction.

321
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:51,860
This is similar to the setting direction of the sewing line.

322
00:18:51,860 --> 00:18:53,860
Therefore, it is necessary to maintain

323
00:18:53,860 --> 00:18:55,860
that the two lines are parallel to each other.

324
00:18:55,860 --> 00:18:59,860
In addition, if you want to connect a whole line to multiple lines,

325
00:18:59,860 --> 00:19:01,860
press the Shift key on the keyboard,

326
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:03,860
and select the multiple lines to be linked.

327
00:19:03,860 --> 00:19:07,860
You can see that two lines are linked to one line.

328
00:19:07,860 --> 00:19:09,860
After clicking on the line,

329
00:19:09,860 --> 00:19:12,860
you can see that the linked lines are connected through the sewing line,

330
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:15,860
and there are double-line arrows at the center of the sewing line.

331
00:19:15,860 --> 00:19:18,860
If you select the empty area in the second window,

332
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:21,860
the sewing line of the linked line will be hidden.

333
00:19:21,860 --> 00:19:24,860
You can click on the line again to display the empty line,

334
00:19:24,860 --> 00:19:28,860
so as to check whether they are linked.

335
00:19:28,860 --> 00:19:31,860
Select the Edit sewing line tool,

336
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:33,860
select the line with teeth below,

337
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,860
and show that the lines here have been sewed.

338
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:39,860
You can use the Edit sewing line tool to quickly link the lines.

339
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:43,860
On the sewing line, right-click and select Link Line.

340
00:19:43,860 --> 00:19:47,860
You can see that the sewed lines have been linked.

341
00:19:47,860 --> 00:19:49,860
In the state of selecting the Edit sewing line tool,

342
00:19:49,860 --> 00:19:52,860
right-click and select Link Line.

343
00:19:52,860 --> 00:19:55,860
Click on Unlink to cancel the link.

344
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:59,860
Remember, if you delete the sewing line directly from the link line,

345
00:19:59,860 --> 00:20:02,860
the link line will be automatically removed.

346
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:05,860
After the link line is set,

347
00:20:05,860 --> 00:20:07,860
select the Edit sewing line tool,

348
00:20:07,860 --> 00:20:10,860
and select two lines on the edit sewing line,

349
00:20:10,860 --> 00:20:11,860
and drag them down.

350
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:13,860
As you can see,

351
00:20:13,860 --> 00:20:16,860
the linked line with teeth is also modified.

352
00:20:16,860 --> 00:20:18,860
Similarly, the line with teeth is moved up and down,

353
00:20:18,860 --> 00:20:20,860
and the line with teeth is moved up and down.

354
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:22,860
When the line with teeth is moved up and down,

355
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,860
the line with teeth is also changed.

356
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:26,860
When selecting the point to modify,

357
00:20:26,860 --> 00:20:29,860
only the point on the linked line will be modified together.

358
00:20:29,860 --> 00:20:34,860
The point on the linked line will remain unchanged.

359
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:36,860
Come to the sewing line,

360
00:20:36,860 --> 00:20:38,860
and set the sewing line to Link.

361
00:20:38,860 --> 00:20:41,860
Note that the length of the two linked lines here is different.

362
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:44,860
At this time, you can use the Edit sewing line tool

363
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:46,860
to check the edit sewing line.

364
00:20:46,860 --> 00:20:48,860
Select Edit sewing line,

365
00:20:48,860 --> 00:20:50,860
press and move the point of the linked line,

366
00:20:50,860 --> 00:20:52,860
and you can modify the length of the linked line.

367
00:20:52,860 --> 00:20:54,860
On the linked line,

368
00:20:54,860 --> 00:20:57,860
right-click and select the three editing options.

369
00:20:57,860 --> 00:20:59,860
Let's take a look at each option.

370
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,860
The first one is to remove the linked line.

371
00:21:01,860 --> 00:21:04,860
The button can remove the linked line.

372
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:06,860
The second one is to turn the direction.

373
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:09,860
The button can change the direction of the linked line.

374
00:21:09,860 --> 00:21:12,860
At this time, there is only one arrow direction on the sewing line,

375
00:21:12,860 --> 00:21:15,860
and it is used to distinguish the direction of the linked line.

376
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:16,860
When displaying a single arrow,

377
00:21:16,860 --> 00:21:19,860
the linked line will move in the same direction.

378
00:21:19,860 --> 00:21:21,860
When displaying a double arrow,

379
00:21:21,860 --> 00:21:23,860
it will move in the opposite direction.

380
00:21:23,860 --> 00:21:31,860
In addition, the turning direction can also be set in the attribute editor on the right side.

381
00:21:31,860 --> 00:21:35,860
The last option is to add a sewing line to the linked line.

382
00:21:35,860 --> 00:21:38,860
Only when the linked line is not sewed,

383
00:21:38,860 --> 00:21:40,860
can this option be seen.

384
00:21:40,860 --> 00:21:44,860
You can automatically sew the linked line through the button.

385
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:47,860
After the pocket and side seams are all modified,

386
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:51,860
simulate and check the modified results in the 3D window.

387
00:21:54,860 --> 00:21:58,580
Come to the

388
00:21:58,580 --> 00:22:02,860
In addition to the linked line length with the editing link tool mentioned earlier,

389
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:08,860
you can also add a straight line on the line and then link the part lines.

390
00:22:08,860 --> 00:22:10,860
Using this method,

391
00:22:10,860 --> 00:22:12,860
the linked line will be linked to the hanging line,

392
00:22:12,860 --> 00:22:13,860
and the linked line will be modified.

393
00:22:14,860 --> 00:22:15,860
In addition,

394
00:22:15,860 --> 00:22:17,860
all lines can be automatically generated and linked

395
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:21,860
when using the hook and loop tool to create a board.

396
00:22:21,860 --> 00:22:22,860
First,

397
00:22:22,860 --> 00:22:25,860
create the inner line of the pocket at the front chest of the clip,

398
00:22:25,860 --> 00:22:27,860
select the hook and loop tool,

399
00:22:27,860 --> 00:22:29,860
select the pocket line,

400
00:22:29,860 --> 00:22:34,860
and click the right button on the line to see the option of connecting the hook as a board.

401
00:22:34,860 --> 00:22:36,860
Click it,

402
00:22:36,860 --> 00:22:38,860
and the hooked board will be displayed.

403
00:22:38,860 --> 00:22:41,860
After placing the 2D board in the blank area,

404
00:22:41,860 --> 00:22:42,860
you can see that the pocket and the large board are linked.

405
00:22:42,860 --> 00:22:45,860
The pocket and the large board are completely linked.

406
00:22:45,860 --> 00:22:46,860
Then,

407
00:22:46,860 --> 00:22:49,860
use the editing link tool to add the linked line.

408
00:22:50,860 --> 00:22:51,860
After adding the linked line,

409
00:22:51,860 --> 00:22:53,860
add the board to the outside.

410
00:22:59,860 --> 00:23:03,860
Use the editing board tool to modify the pocket board.

411
00:23:03,860 --> 00:23:06,860
You can try to check the effect in the 3D window.

412
00:23:06,860 --> 00:23:07,860
In addition,

413
00:23:07,860 --> 00:23:09,860
when the length of the linked line changes,

414
00:23:09,860 --> 00:23:11,860
the length of the linked line will also automatically match the length.

415
00:23:11,860 --> 00:23:12,860
After modifying,

416
00:23:12,860 --> 00:23:17,860
you can use the editing link tool to remove the linked line.

417
00:23:20,860 --> 00:23:23,860
The best way to use this function is

418
00:23:23,860 --> 00:23:26,860
to organize the deck board according to the previous order,

419
00:23:26,860 --> 00:23:28,860
and to simulate the floating board.

420
00:23:28,860 --> 00:23:30,860
After the shape of the clothing is simulated,

421
00:23:30,860 --> 00:23:33,860
select multiple floating lines and set them as linked lines.

422
00:23:33,860 --> 00:23:36,860
This way, you can edit the linked lines and use them at the same time.

423
00:23:36,860 --> 00:23:37,860
By following this procedure,

424
00:23:37,860 --> 00:23:39,860
you can greatly simplify the setting process.

425
00:23:41,860 --> 00:23:44,860
The following is the introduction of the UI interface.

426
00:23:44,860 --> 00:23:45,860
Next,

427
00:23:45,860 --> 00:23:49,860
we will talk about the update and improvement of the Closet in the Closet software.

428
00:23:49,860 --> 00:23:54,860
In order to use the Closet database and Closet data more easily,

429
00:23:54,860 --> 00:23:57,860
we have improved four functions in the 7.3 version.

430
00:23:57,860 --> 00:23:59,860
Let's take a look at them one by one.

431
00:23:59,860 --> 00:24:00,860
First,

432
00:24:00,860 --> 00:24:02,860
we have updated the Closet spreadsheet.

433
00:24:02,860 --> 00:24:03,860
In the previous version,

434
00:24:03,860 --> 00:24:08,860
when the Closet and Connect in the Closet window are downloaded,

435
00:24:08,860 --> 00:24:10,860
the preview image of the project will be displayed.

436
00:24:10,860 --> 00:24:13,860
The preview image of the project is not displayed when the file is saved.

437
00:24:13,860 --> 00:24:14,860
Now,

438
00:24:14,860 --> 00:24:15,860
when the function is updated,

439
00:24:15,860 --> 00:24:16,860
whether it is downloaded or not,

440
00:24:16,860 --> 00:24:18,860
the preview image will always be displayed.

441
00:24:18,860 --> 00:24:19,860
For example,

442
00:24:19,860 --> 00:24:20,860
in the previous version,

443
00:24:20,860 --> 00:24:22,860
in the Closet Connect,

444
00:24:22,860 --> 00:24:27,860
after downloading some projects such as the chain or the button,

445
00:24:27,860 --> 00:24:29,860
the preview image will be immediately changed.

446
00:24:29,860 --> 00:24:32,860
When we try to check them again,

447
00:24:32,860 --> 00:24:36,860
the preview image and the preview image will be confused.

448
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:38,860
Through the improvement of this function,

449
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:40,860
even if we choose and download the previous one,

450
00:24:40,860 --> 00:24:42,860
the preview image will be displayed.

451
00:24:42,860 --> 00:24:44,860
The preview image will also be displayed as a screenshot,

452
00:24:44,860 --> 00:24:46,860
so as to reduce confusion.

453
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:47,860
Secondly,

454
00:24:47,860 --> 00:24:51,860
a new folder named all contents has been added to the Closet.

455
00:24:51,860 --> 00:24:52,860
In the past,

456
00:24:52,860 --> 00:24:54,860
we want to search for a certain file,

457
00:24:54,860 --> 00:24:59,860
we must enter the collection content or the required company database,

458
00:24:59,860 --> 00:25:01,860
and search for the project name.

459
00:25:01,860 --> 00:25:02,860
Through this improvement,

460
00:25:02,860 --> 00:25:04,860
we can directly select all the contents,

461
00:25:04,860 --> 00:25:06,860
and search for the required project name,

462
00:25:06,860 --> 00:25:09,860
which will display all the projects with the name.

463
00:25:10,860 --> 00:25:11,860
Thirdly,

464
00:25:11,860 --> 00:25:13,860
the search related functions have been improved.

465
00:25:13,860 --> 00:25:15,860
Before version 7.3,

466
00:25:15,860 --> 00:25:18,860
the file information in the folder was searched,

467
00:25:18,860 --> 00:25:20,860
but from this version,

468
00:25:20,860 --> 00:25:24,860
the information in the Closet has been changed to search.

469
00:25:24,860 --> 00:25:25,860
In the past,

470
00:25:25,860 --> 00:25:26,860
when searching for a keyword,

471
00:25:26,860 --> 00:25:27,860
if there is no result,

472
00:25:27,860 --> 00:25:30,860
there will not be a single prompt message,

473
00:25:30,860 --> 00:25:31,860
but from the new version,

474
00:25:31,860 --> 00:25:35,860
it will clearly display the prompt that there is no search result,

475
00:25:35,860 --> 00:25:36,860
so that you can be more intuitive

476
00:25:36,860 --> 00:25:39,860
to check whether the current search can be completed.

477
00:25:40,860 --> 00:25:42,860
Next is the final improvement.

478
00:25:42,860 --> 00:25:44,860
Before version 7.3,

479
00:25:44,860 --> 00:25:46,860
select the file from the library,

480
00:25:46,860 --> 00:25:48,860
such as the T2M copy file.

481
00:25:48,860 --> 00:25:50,860
You need to download them first,

482
00:25:50,860 --> 00:25:52,860
add them to the object window,

483
00:25:52,860 --> 00:25:54,860
and drag them to the 3D window board,

484
00:25:54,860 --> 00:25:59,860
or directly download them to the copy and drag them to the board.

485
00:25:59,860 --> 00:26:01,860
From version 7.3,

486
00:26:01,860 --> 00:26:02,860
after selecting the file,

487
00:26:02,860 --> 00:26:05,860
you can drag them directly to the board corresponding to the 3D window,

488
00:26:05,860 --> 00:26:07,860
and then download them.

489
00:26:07,860 --> 00:26:09,860
Reduce operation time.

490
00:26:10,860 --> 00:26:11,860
Next,

491
00:26:11,860 --> 00:26:14,860
I will introduce the improvement of the color version UI interface.

492
00:26:14,860 --> 00:26:16,860
In the previous version,

493
00:26:16,860 --> 00:26:19,860
even if the color block in the custom color version does not exist,

494
00:26:19,860 --> 00:26:21,860
it will be saved.

